   1393  f857							; Bar H3c tables (B=0..120): content ≤71c (WSYNC 3c fits in 76).
   1394  f857							; Paths (cycles after WSYNC → sty red): F=0 slim 12+5A; F=1 slim+nop 14+5A;
   1395  f857							; F=2 full 20+5A; F=3 full 30+5A; F=4 full 31+5A (A=0 special-cased).
   1396  f857							; D2 (2026-10-16): both tables were EXACTLY period-8 ([1-8],[9-16],…) so
   1397  f857							; they shrank 121→15 entries, indexed (B+7)>>3 (see the reader). Entry 0 =
   1398  f857							; B=0; entry g≥1 = B in [8(g-1)+1, 8g]. Verified against the old 121B blobs.
